      "settings.commitMessage.override.title": "\xD6zel prompt Kullan",
      "settings.commitMessage.override.description": "Varsay\u0131lan commit message i\xE7in olan prompt de\u011Ferini ge\xE7ersiz k\u0131l. Etkinle\u015Ftirildi\u011Finde, \xF6zel prompt de\u011Feriniz yerle\u015Fik conventional commits i\xE7in olan prompt de\u011Ferini tamamen de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir.",
